# examples/asn1/demo.asn1 in the ALIGNED variant. Found by
# byte mutation, derived by hand from X.691 (02/2021) 20.6, 11.9.3.8.
#
# Unsupported-2 ::= SEQUENCE OF Alpha, 3 bits an element (Alpha has 8
# values). 16385 elements: c1 (one fragment of 16K components, 11.9.3.8),
# 6144 octets holding 16384 elements, then the rest as a length, 01, and
# one element, 001 (alpha04): c1 00..00 01 20.
#
# rasn 0.28 rejects it ("Need more data to continue: Size(1)"), and accepts
# the 16384 elements alone (c1 00..00 00): it misreads what follows a
# fragment of a SEQUENCE OF.
deviates rasn Unsupported-2
# pycrate 0.7.11's ALIGNED encoder fails on a fragmented SEQUENCE OF
# (x691-sizes.vec); its decoder reads the above
deviates-encode pycrate Unsupported-2
